'''Moons''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by purchasing the 11th tier of the Battle Pass in the [[Halloween Event 2024]] it costs 8,000 [[Candies (2024)|candies]] {{Currency|1=Candies2024|2=25px}}.

== Appearance ==
It has a dark blue-black blade with a full moon, half-moon and two other variations of the moon, hence the name.
